          "h_title": "Retractable Pergola Systems",
          "main_title": "Retractable Pergola Systems",
          "author": null,
          "language": "en",
          "level": 1,
          "primary_content": [
           {
            "text": "Shade for All Seasons",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "At last, you can put an outdoor roof over your head with Shade for Life top-end retractable systems at Melbourne’s most attractive prices. Retractable Pergola Systems (also called retractable roof systems) are the latest must-have trend for creating a distinctive outdoor room.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "You can’t control the weather, but you can control your lifestyle – get a climate advantage and put the power in your hands with jam-free remote control operation.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Precision engineering and architectural quality at an attractive price – sophisticated European know-how and Aussie smarts combine to offer you innovative technology for your price point.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Add value to your home – a smart investment in your home that will be enjoyed for years, and return tenfold over time. Add lighting, timber cladding, vertical blinds and heating as desired.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "A Shade for Life retractable pergola system is just like a roof, but better! – As Australia’s market leaders, Shade for Life is ahead in attention to detail, service, price and quality.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Need plans, permits, lighting or design advice? – Ask us how, we have over 10 years of experience and a reputation that you can rely on.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           },
           {
            "text": "Explore our quality range of retractable systems today….",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
           }
          ],
